# Collision & Layers

## Assignment constraints (not yet designed)

- Use layer collision matrix — not tag comparisons inside `OnTriggerEnter`
- Projectiles must not tunnel; must not hit shooter or other projectiles
- Crate must not clip through geometry or push player through walls
- Stomp vs side-hit discrimination must hold at full fall speed and 30 fps
- Knockback does not cost a life; falls and side hits do

## When design is established

Document the layer layout and collision approach in the relevant folder `AGENTS.md` and in `README.md`. Do not invent layers or collision code until then.
